models/base/
# Cloud image weights: keep only the serving best.pt of every committed detect/ run, via ONE
# broad pattern (no per-model lockstep with Dockerfile.cloud / models.json). Adding a model =
# drop its best.pt under models/runs/detect/<run>/weights/ + register it in models.json; nothing
# here changes. Everything else under runs/ (last.pt, onnx, openvino, args/results) stays out of
# the image to keep it lean.
models/runs/**
!models/runs/detect/**/weights/best.pt

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
